        "title": "Speciation: Mechanisms and Models",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Speciation is the process by which one ancestral lineage splits into two or more\nlineages that are reproductively isolated from each other. It is the origin of the\ndiversity of life."
    },
    {
      "id": "04-SPECIATION.md#003",
      "path": [
        "04-SPECIATION.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:evolutionary-biology:04-speciation, git-history:evolutionary-biology:04-speciation]",
        "canonical_path": "evolutionary-biology/04-SPECIATION.md",
        "concepts": "[speciation]",
        "current_path": "evolutionary-biology/04-SPECIATION.md",
        "id": "maxim:evolutionary-biology:speciation",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "evolutionary-biology",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[speciation]",
        "section": "evolutionary-biology",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Speciation: Mechanisms and Models",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\n┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                    SPECIATION FRAMEWORK                          │\n│                                                                  │\n│  GEOGRAPHIC ARRANGEMENT          REPRODUCTIVE ISOLATION          │\n│  ─────────────────────────       ──────────────────────          │\n│  Allopatric: populations          Prezygotic:                    │\n│    physically separated           - Ecological (habitat)         │\n│    (mountain range, ocean)        - Temporal (season)            │\n│                                   - Behavioral (mate choice)     │\n│  Parapatric: adjacent zones       - Mechanical (morphology)      │\n│    with limited contact           - Gametic (sperm-egg incomp.)  │\n│                                                                  │\n│  Sympatric: same geographic       Postzygotic:                   │\n│    area, diverging anyway         - Hybrid inviability           │\n│                                   - Hybrid sterility (F1)        │\n│  Peripatric: small peripheral     - Hybrid breakdown (F2)        │\n│    population diverges            Dobzhansky-Muller model        │\n└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```"
    },
