        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Speciation: Mechanisms and Models",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Requires: strong enough disruptive selection AND assortative mating (mate preference\ncorrelated with the trait under selection) to overcome homogenizing gene flow."
    },
